.TH geectl-local-build-prune 1  "geectl-local-build-prune 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-local\-build\-prune \- Print the eviction plan (what would be evicted, in order, with bytes); delete only with `\-\-apply`. The plan is the default: the leaf\*(Aqs own `\-\-apply` is the confirmation, so the scheduled task runs exactly `prune \-\-apply`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl local\-build prune\fR [\fB\-\-apply\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the eviction plan (what would be evicted, in order, with bytes); delete only with `\-\-apply`. The plan is the default: the leaf\*(Aqs own `\-\-apply` is the confirmation, so the scheduled task runs exactly `prune \-\-apply`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-apply\fR
Delete what the plan lists
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
